  "overview": "**Databricks** is a light-first design system anchored on `#ffffff` canvas surfaces with `#8b5a0e` primary ink (5.9:1 contrast) and `#9e102c` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `DM Sans` (48px display down to 13px body), unified by `4px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nSource: published token package, package `@databricks/design-system`. Inventory: **91** colors, **40** typography steps, and **73** documented components (ISC license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 73 component tokens with documented paddings: `0 16px`, `0`, `5px 8px`, `16px 16px`, `6px 8px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#f0f8ff` cards; separate sibling sections using `#f5f5f5` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.015)`, `0 3px 6px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), 0 6px 16px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), 0 9px 28px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)`) paired with `#f5f5f5` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#9e102c` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#ffffff` (light) with `#8b5a0e` primary text and `#8b5a0e` secondary labels.\n- Use `#9e102c` with `#f7f7f8` text (7.6:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `DM Sans` headings with `DM Sans` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `4px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (4px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#f0f8ff` surface shifts and `#f5f5f5` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `4px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `du-bois-light-input` fields and secondary buttons."
